    fix: harden link enrichment after live backfill failures
    
    First 3.7k backfill run: 79% failures + crash. Root causes and fixes:
    
    - Eligibility excluded only /status/ tweets; x.com/i/article (551
      auth-walled failures), YouTube pages, and PDFs now excluded too.
