      completion) retry twice with backoff+jitter, backfill default
      concurrency drops to 2 with per-worker pacing (--concurrency flag).
    - Process died from an HTTP/2 stream 'error' event escaping fetch's
      promise chain: backfill installs scoped uncaughtException/
      unhandledRejection guards for the long run.
    - Backfill start prunes cached failures that are no longer eligible;
      --retry-failed re-attempts transient failures without the 7-day
      wait. Exit summary reports top error kinds.
    
    Suite: 842/842.

